# Build scratch that Unreal regenerates on its own.
Saved/
*.sln
.vs/

# Debug symbols. 62 MB per build, and nobody consuming a plugin needs them.
*.pdb

# NOTE: Intermediate/ is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# This repo ships a *packaged* plugin. The precompiled Game objects under
# Intermediate/Build/Win64/x64/UnrealGame/ are what let a Blueprint-only
# project package a build without a C++ toolchain installed. Ignore this
# folder and that quietly stops working, and the failure only turns up at
# packaging time, long after anyone would connect it to a .gitignore rule.
#
# Binaries/ is deliberately not ignored either. The prebuilt DLL is the
# whole point of this repo.
